# Pulse Exchange canonical counterparty accounts (replaces the shared
# "Pulse Exchange" supplier/customer from 20271006144616).
# Marketplace awards post to one party per counterparty org: the existing linked
# row when the orgs are connected, otherwise an unlinked Marketplace account
# (server-side mapping, hidden from pickers, promoted in place on connect).
# Adds exchange_trips enrollment, the DCO payee lane, the fee-only
# "Pulse Marketplace (fees)" party, get_non_selectable_party_ids, and
# list_exchange_trips (Finance Marketplace trips lane).
# Drops ensure_pulse_exchange_parties: the matching app build must deploy with it.
# Fails closed if any 'pulse_exchange' party or exchange_payments row exists.
# Requires pulse-exchange-party (20271006142659, 20271006144616) applied.
# Apply only after explicit production authorization.
